			</li>
			<li Class="ScenPart_GameStartDialog">
				<def>GameStartDialog</def>
				<text>The wind carries the scent of pine and damp earth as your trio steps out onto the fresh soil. Underneath your masks, your breath comes in steady, quiet rhythms. In your small hands, the weight of chipped obsidian feels as familiar as breath itself.

You have spent too many seasons moving under cover of darkness, sleeping in hollowed ruins, and trading swift strikes for small moments of peace and whatever chocolate you could scrounge along the way. Open roads offer no lasting shelter for those who walk in the margins.

Looking out over this silent patch of wilderness, the drifting ends. It is time to drop your packs, mark your territory, and carve out a home where the masked and the small need never run again.</text>
				<closeSound>GameStartSting</closeSound>
